{"version":1,"content":"<p>從現代烹飪與食品科學的角度而言，魚與羊分別含鮮味（Umami）的肌苷酸和谷氨酸，兩者結合更達致加乘效應，程度呈幾何級激增；</p><p>搜羅城中多間餐廳供應的魚及羊饌，讓食饕過足鮮味口癮！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;源起眾說紛紜&lt;br/&gt;鮮，由魚加</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.682589+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T06:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.327673+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"11107fce01fee897e5bf8f4e88d03f1251d42dc1855cd1700372e0e0a1996e7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}